yin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yù","traditional":"喻","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"诸","pinyin":"zhū","traditional":"諸","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"未","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǒu","traditional":"有","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Yao (Giau) dan Sun dengan Cinta Kasih memerintah dunia, maka rakyatpun mengikutinya. Kiat dan Tiu dengan kebuasan memerintah dunia, maka rakyatpun mengikutinya. Perintah yang tidak sesuai dengan kehendak rakyat, rakyat takkan menurut; maka seorang Junzi - Kuncu lebih dahulu menuntut diri sendiri, baharu kemudian mengharap dari orang lain. Bila diri sendiri sudah tak bercacat baharu boleh mengharapkan dari orang lain. Bila diri sendiri belum dapat bersikap Tepasarira (Tahu Menimbang/Tenggang rasa), tetapi berharap dapat memperbaiki orang lain, itulah suatu hal yang belum pernah terjadi. (S.S. V: 12; XV: 24)"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.10.05","number":5,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"gù","traditional":"故","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"治","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"国","pinyin":"guó","traditional":"國","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zài","traditional":"在","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"齐","pinyin":"qí","traditional":"齊","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qí","traditional":"其","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiā","traditional":"家","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Maka teraturnya negara itu sesungguhnya berpangkal pada keberesan dalam rumah tangga."},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.daxue.10.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"type":"text","value":"《"},{"modern":"诗","pinyin":"shī","traditional":"詩","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"》"},{"pinyin":"yún","traditional":"云",